{"book": "PSA", "chapter": 27, "lang": "es", "bible": "RV1909-2026", "engine": "chatterbox-videos-v1", "durationMs": 123826, "verses": [{"verse": 1, "start": 300, "end": 10836, "text": "Salmo de David. JEHOVÁ es mi luz y mi salvación: ¿de quién temeré? Jehová es la fortaleza de mi vida: ¿de quién he de atemorizarme?", "words": [[0, 300], [6, 764], [9, 924], [16, 1834], [23, 2060], [26, 2287], [29, 2607], [33, 2927], [35, 3427], [38, 3547], [49, 4675], [53, 4995], [59, 5255], [67, 6249], [74, 6717], [77, 6877], [80, 7037], [90, 7857], [93, 8037], [96, 8157], [102, 8903], [106, 9029], [112, 9289], [115, 9589], [118, 9709]]}, {"verse": 2, "start": 11186, "end": 20320, "text": "Cuando se acercaron contra mí los malignos, mis angustiadores y mis enemigos, para comer mis carnes, ellos tropezaron y cayeron.", "words": [[0, 11186], [7, 11349], [10, 11609], [20, 12309], [27, 12689], [30, 12949], [34, 13129], [44, 13869], [48, 14269], [62, 15149], [64, 15409], [68, 15529], [78, 16229], [83, 16849], [89, 17169], [93, 17409], [101, 18049], [107, 18529], [118, 19389], [120, 19609]]}, {"verse": 3, "start": 20670, "end": 28494, "text": "Aunque acampe ejército contra mí, no temerá mi corazón: aunque contra mí se levante guerra, yo en esto confío.", "words": [[0, 20670], [7, 21010], [14, 21490], [23, 22030], [30, 22390], [34, 22990], [37, 23150], [44, 23650], [47, 23870], [56, 24793], [63, 25055], [70, 25435], [73, 25675], [76, 25835], [84, 26195], [92, 27135], [95, 27495], [98, 27655], [103, 27815]]}, {"verse": 4, "start": 28844, "end": 41761, "text": "Una cosa he pedido a Jehová, esta buscaré: que esté yo en la casa de Jehová todos los días de mi vida, para contemplar la hermosura de Jehová, y para inquirir en su templo.", "words": [[0, 28844], [4, 29008], [9, 29368], [12, 29688], [19, 30168], [21, 30308], [29, 31148], [34, 31408], [43, 32302], [47, 32424], [52, 32704], [55, 33044], [58, 33284], [61, 33424], [66, 33744], [69, 33964], [76, 34404], [82, 34644], [86, 35004], [91, 353